  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 18.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="18.2" corresp="#wit-h">Gif heo sy syxhynde, C scll' gebete ðam þe hit gebyrie.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="18.2" corresp="#wit-e">Gif hio sie syxhyndu, hundteontig scill. geselle þam byrgean.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="18.2" corresp="#wit-q">Si est VIhynda, C solid. emendetur marito.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="21.1" corresp="#wit-e">Gif hio sie syxhynda, hundteonig scill geselle þa<hi rend="italic">m</hi> byrgean.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e">If she is [of] 600 [rank], let her compensate the guarantor with 100 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e">If her wergeld is 600 shillings, she shall pay 100 shillings to the surety [of the marriage].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">If she is a woman of a six-hundred wergild, 100 shillings are to be given to the surety.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn sie 600 [Sch.-Wergeld werth] ist, gebe sie jenem Bürgen 100 Schilling.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If she is [worth] 600 [shillings’ wergeld], let her give that surety 100 shillings.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
